@0    = ~Before you have time to marvel at all that surrounds you, knowledge flows steadily from the faintly shimmering nexus ahead, pouring unceasingly into your thoughts. And thus you know where you are.~
@1    = ~This is a dimension beyond space, an eternity across time, where the cycle of life and death knows no end and the conflict between good and evil rages without cease. It is one of the most uncanny and perilous demiplanes among the countless offshoots of Torto.~
@2    = ~"The Dimensional Arena."~
@3    = ~In the name of Torto:~
@4    = ~Reveal to me the path to victory.~
@5    = ~Create for me a blade of battle.~
@6    = ~Manifest for me the place of trial.~
@7    = ~Open for me the planar gate.~
@8    = ~End dialogue.~

@10   = ~Challenge the Baatezu squad.~
@11   = ~Challenge the Tanar'ri pack.~
@12   = ~Challenge the Whisper.~
@13   = ~Challenge the Soulless.~
@14   = ~Challenge the Godslayer.~
@15   = ~Return to the previous menu.~
@16   = ~Open the Dimensional Shop.~
@17   = ~Activate Regional Scourge: Starfall.~
@18   = ~Deactivate Regional Scourge: Starfall.~
